  "description": "\r\n\r\nCertificate of\r\nLawful Development (Proposed): Change of Use from HMO (Class C4) to providing\r\ncare for children age 7-17&nbsp;(Class C3(b)) with a total of five residents",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 0cm 5.4pt;&quot;&gt;The proposed use of the dwellinghouse as a supported living accommodation facility for up to 5 residents (Use Class C3(b)) would not result in a material change of use from Class C3 (Dwellinghouse) and would therefore be within the tolerances of the Town and Country Planning (Use Class) Order 1987 (as amended).&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 0cm 5.4pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;padding: 0cm 5.4pt;&quot;&gt;The proposal is therefore a lawful development.&lt;/div&gt;"
